  "id": "role-set",
  "term": "role set",
  "definition": "A role set is the pattern of roles within a team and how those roles relate to one another in their expected capabilities and responsibilities. In changing teams, a role set may be more disconnected or more intersecting, which can affect how flexibly members coordinate their work.",
